"start":165,"end":167,"surface":"今王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0172","start":172,"end":173,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0186","start":186,"end":188,"surface":"祖伊","kind":"person","person_id":"61b_fc5_6h4","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0193","start":193,"end":194,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0200","start":200,"end":202,"surface":"西伯","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_A","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0205","start":205,"end":208,"surface":"周武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0232","start":232,"end":233,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0238","start":238,"end":240,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p031","text":"紂愈淫亂不止。微子數諫不聽，乃與大師、少師謀，遂去。比干曰：「為人臣者，不得不以死爭。」迺強諫紂。紂怒曰：「吾聞聖人心有七竅。」剖比干，觀其心。箕子懼，乃詳狂為奴，紂又囚之。殷之大師、少師乃持其祭樂器奔周。周武王於是遂率諸侯伐紂。紂亦發兵距之牧野。甲子日，紂兵敗。紂走，入登鹿臺，衣其寶玉衣，赴火而死。周武王遂斬紂頭，縣之大白旗。殺妲己。釋箕子之囚，封比干之墓，表商容之閭。封紂子武庚祿父，以續殷祀，令修行盤庚之政。殷民大說。於是周武王為天子。其後世貶帝號，號為王。而封殷後為諸侯，屬周。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m031-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m031-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"微子","kind":"person","person_id":"buv_igi_gpn_A","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m031-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"大師","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shi