。勉哉夫子，不可再，不可三！」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0014","start":14,"end":18,"surface":"王子比干","kind":"person","person_id":"xtq_oi8_w82","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"箕子","kind":"person","person_id":"8a9_tj8_6i7","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"太師疵","kind":"person","person_id":"grr_fo8_y9b","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"少師彊","kind":"person","person_id":"hzx_kl2_8vp","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"文王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_A","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0092","start":92,"end":93,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0123","start":123,"end":125,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0139","start":139,"end":142,"surface":"殷王紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0145","start":145,"end":147,"surface":"婦人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未定個人、群體或氏族稱謂；不推造個別姓名與成員數目。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0164","start":164,"end":168,"surface":"王父母弟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未定個人、群體或氏族稱謂；不推造個別姓名與成員數目。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0173","start":173,"end":175,"surface":"先祖","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未定個人、群體或氏族稱謂；不推造個別姓名與成員數目。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0191","start":191,"end":193,"surface":"婦人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未定個人、群體或氏族稱謂；不推造個別姓名與成員數目。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0197","start":197,"end":198,"surface":"發","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依武王自述與太子發的敘事暫定；不連到夏王發。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p018","text":"封商紂子祿父殷之餘民。武王為殷初定未集，乃使其弟管叔鮮、蔡叔度相祿父治殷。已而命召公釋箕子之囚。命畢公釋百姓之囚，表商容之閭。命南宮括散鹿臺之財，發鉅橋之粟，以振貧弱萌隸。命南宮括、史佚展九鼎保玉。命閎夭封比干之墓。命宗祝享祠于軍。乃罷兵西歸。行狩，記政事，作《武成》。封諸侯，班賜宗彝，作《分殷之器物》。武王追思先聖王，乃褒封神農之後於焦，黃帝之後於祝，帝堯之後於薊，帝舜之後於陳，大禹之後於杞。於是封功臣謀士，而師尚父為首封。封尚父於營丘，曰齊。封弟周公旦於曲阜，曰魯。封召公奭於燕。封弟叔鮮于管，弟叔度於蔡。餘各以次受封。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"商紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"祿父","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7_A","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"管叔鮮","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AB","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"蔡叔度","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AC","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"祿父","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7_A","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"召公","kind":"person","person_id":"7m7_qvm_4oj","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"箕子","kind":"person","person_id":"8a9_tj8_6i7","status":"source_identified"